  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BEP 52 (BitTorrent v2) interop fixes: correct merkle pad propagation, libtorrent-compatible piece-layer hash chunking, virtual padding past file_num_pieces, thread-safe piece-layer cache, and request dedup. HTTP streaming: RFC 7233 suffix-byte-range support, stricter rejection of malformed Range headers, ArrayPool-backed buffers, and cancellation. Hardened path validation in the torrent builder against `.`/`..` segments. Various smaller fixes around torrent disposal, tracker scrape, and storage.",
